{"_id":"68dcfbe0166b018f83df7bc6","roadmapSlug":"css","nodeId":"U3oH6TFRezkciuROAU0wd","description":"# Text Spacing\n\nText spacing in CSS involves adjusting the space between characters, words, and lines of text. This control allows for improved readability and visual appeal by fine-tuning the horizontal and vertical spacing within text elements. Properties like `letter-spacing`, `word-spacing`, and `line-height` are used to manipulate these spaces.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"letter-spacing","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/letter-spacing","_id":"6a67293033d15c83102144d1"},{"type":"article","title":"word-spacing","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/word-spacing","_id":"6a67293033d15c83102144d2"},{"type":"article","title":"CSS Text Spacing","url":"https://www.codeguage.com/v1/courses/css/text-spacing","_id":"6a67293033d15c83102144d3"},{"type":"video","title":"HTML & CSS for Absolute Beginners: Line height and spacing","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HaTxxAj3cBo","_id":"6a67293033d15c83102144d4"}],"createdAt":"2025-10-01T10:01:04.357Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-27T09:47:28.129Z","lessonPacks":[{"_id":"6a22adddac1c5fa9928ab3ab","title":"CSS Fundamentals","slug":"css","description":"Style, lay out, and debug real pages without fighting the cascade.","lessonIds":["6a15d62fac1c5fa9928a3fb6","6a15e1b0ac1c5fa9928a403f","6a16f11aac1c5fa9928a7c14","6a19dcdfac1c5fa9928a84a5","6a19e79cac1c5fa9928a8571","6a19f85cac1c5fa9928a8654","6a1d7a23ac1c5fa9928a8b4e","6a1dd2daac1c5fa9928a9884","6a1ecf18ac1c5fa9928a9a81","6a1f3245ac1c5fa9928a9cdd","6a20aa64ac1c5fa9928aa44a","6a20ba69ac1c5fa9928aa755","6a20c105ac1c5fa9928aa818","6a20c2e5ac1c5fa9928aa847","6a20c490ac1c5fa9928aa871","6a20c5adac1c5fa9928aa884","6a20c6a5ac1c5fa9928aa897","6a20c7c5ac1c5fa9928aa8aa","6a20ca2fac1c5fa9928aa8d0","6a20cb82ac1c5fa9928aa8e3"],"projectIds":["68b7185fffbff9183d772aed","68b7185fffbff9183d772aee","68b7185fffbff9183d772af0","68b7185fffbff9183d772af